  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Set aside and allow to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d28571ea2759f5d13537c-5e96ea0f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice apple/pear into wedges.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d28571ea2759f5d13537c-84b5bfe6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small heatproof bowl, microwave garlic paste (see ingredients) and a drizzle of olive oil in 10 second bursts until fragrant.\n• To garlic oil, add miso paste, the honey, a good squeeze of lemon juice and sesame seeds. Stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d28571ea2759f5d13537c-b886cf2f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While sweet potato is cooling, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• In the last minute of cook time, add sweet chilli sauce, the low sodium soy sauce and a splash of water, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d28571ea2759f5d13537c-2c0e2207.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine roasted sweet potato, apple/pear, cucumber, mixed salad leaves and miso dressing. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d28571ea2759f5d13537c-e5206ce2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sesame miso salad between bowls.\n• Top with Japanese glazed tofu, crispy shallots and pickled ginger.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d28571ea2759f5d13537c-f7f06f18.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
